  "rules": "Two wings each reuse an earlier verb. West wing: turn the mirror so the lamp beam reaches receiver O1 (the crate b2 is in the way). East wing: hold plate H3 with boulder b1. Solving a wing lights its seal crystal for good (s1/s2) and opens its cargo gate (X1/X2). Leaving a wing before it is sealed resets that wing. The grand gates G1/G2 open while both seals are lit AND both central hold plates H1/H2 are held - and the only boulders that can reach them are the wing pieces, so each must be routed out of its wing after sealing. Wing doorways are sills (people only); boulders leave through the cargo gates. The reset crystal R1 restores boulders and mirrors but not seals.",
